    [2805]={name="Yeti Fur Cloak",quality=2,ilvl=34,reqLevel=29,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak'. Starts with Bartolo Ginsetti in Hillsbrad Foothills. Objective: Bring Bartolo Ginsetti of Southshore a Bolt of Wool, a Hillman's Cloak, Fine Thread and 10 clumps of Yeti Fur.",zone="Hillsbrad Foothills",questName="Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak",lore="I, the great Bartolo, shall make for you the world famous, Alliance renowned, Yeti Fur Cloak!"},
